---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+17725550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(772) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Mold Inspection & Testing in Fort Pierce, FL | Fort Pierce Mold Specialists" description="Professional mold inspection and testing in Fort Pierce, FL. Moisture mapping, visual assessment, and lab sampling when needed.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Mold Inspection & Testing in Fort Pierce, FL</h1>
      <p>Professional mold inspection and testing in Fort Pierce, FL. Moisture mapping, visual assessment, and lab sampling when needed.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:1.25rem">Call </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
<h2>Thorough Mold Inspection</h2>
<p>Our inspection starts with a detailed visual assessment of your property — attics, crawl spaces, bathrooms, HVAC, and any areas with past water issues. We use moisture meters and hygrometers to find hidden dampness that can fuel growth.</p>
<h2>When Testing Helps</h2>
<p>Air or surface sampling is recommended when the source is unclear, for documentation (insurance, real estate), or after remediation for clearance. Samples are analyzed by an accredited lab.</p>
<ul>
<li>Visual inspection of all accessible areas</li>
<li>Moisture and humidity measurements</li>
<li>Air and surface sampling when appropriate</li>
<li>Clear written findings and recommendations</li>
</ul>
<h2>What to Expect</h2>
<p>Most inspections in Fort Pierce are completed in a single visit. You receive a plain-language summary of what we found and whether remediation is advised.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call Now — </a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
